","xlit":"mâchôwz","pron":"maw-khoze'","from":"from an unused root meaning to enclose;","def":"a harbor (as shut in by the shore)","kjv":"haven.","count":1},"H4232":{"lemma":"מְחוּיָאֵל","xlit":"Mᵉchûwyâʼêl","pron":"mekh-oo-yaw-ale'","from":"or מְחִיּיָאֵל; from H4229 (מָחָה) and H410 (אֵל); smitten of God;","def":"Mechujael or Mechijael, an antediluvian patriarch","kjv":"Mehujael.","count":2},"H4233":{"lemma":"מַחֲוִים","xlit":"Machăvîym","pron":"makh-av-eem'","from":"apparently a patrial, but from an unknown place (in the plural only for a singular);","def":"a Machavite or inhabitant of some place named Machaveh","kjv":"Mahavite.","count":1},"H4234":{"lemma":"מָחוֹל","xlit":"mâchôwl","pron":"maw-khole'","from":"from H2342 (חוּל);","def":"a (round) dance","kjv":"dance(-cing).","count":6},"H4235":{"lemma":"מָחוֹל","xlit":"Mâchôwl","pron":"maw-khole'","from":"the same as H4234 (מָחוֹל); dancing;","def":"Machol, an Israelite","kjv":"Mahol.","count":1},"H4236":{"lemma":"מַחֲזֶה","xlit":"machăzeh","pron":"makh-az-eh'","from":"from H2372 (חָזָה);","def":"a vision","kjv":"vision.","count":4},"H4237":{"lemma":"מֶחֱזָה","xlit":"mechĕzâh","pron":"mekh-ez-aw'","from":"from H2372 (חָזָה);","def":"a window","kjv":"light.","count":4},"H4238":{"lemma":"מַחֲזִיאוֹת","xlit":"Machăzîyʼôwth","pron":"makh-az-ee-oth'","from":"feminine plural from H2372 (חָזָה); visions;","def":"Machazioth, an Israelite","kjv":"Mahazioth.","count":2},"H4239":{"lemma":"מְחִי","xlit":"mᵉchîy","pron":"mekh-ee'","from":"from H4229 (מָחָה);","def":"a stroke, i.e. battering-ram","kjv":"engines.","count":1},"H4240":{"lemma":"מְחִידָא","xlit":"Mᵉchîydâʼ","pron":"mek-ee-daw'","from":"from H2330 (חוּד); junction;","def":"Mechida, one of the Nethinim","kjv":"Mehida.","count":2},"H4241":{"lemma":"מִחְיָה","xlit":"michyâh","pron":"mikh-yaw'","from":"from H2421 (חָיָה);","def":"preservation of life; hence, sustenance; also the live flesh, i.e. the quick","kjv":"preserve life, quick, recover selves, reviving, sustenance, victuals.","count":8},"H4242":{"lemma":"מְחִיר","xlit":"mᵉchîyr","pron":"mekk-eer'","from":"from an unused root meaning to buy;","def":"price, payment, wages","kjv":"gain, hire, price, sold, worth.","count":15},"H4243":{"lemma":"מְחִיר","xlit":"Mᵉchîyr","pron":"mekh-eer'","from":"the same as H4242 (מְחִיר); price;","def":"Mechir, an Israelite","kjv":"Mehir.","count":1},"H4244":{"lemma":"מַחְלָה","xlit":"Machlâh","pron":"makh-law'","from":"from H2470 (חָלָה); sickness;","def":"Machlah, the name apparently of two Israelitesses","kjv":"Mahlah.","count":5},"H4245":{"lemma":"מַחֲלֶה","xlit":"machăleh","pron":"makh-al-eh'","from":"or (feminine) מַחֲלָה; from H2470 (חָלָה);","def":"sickness","kjv":"disease, infirmity, sickness.","count":6},"H4246":{"lemma":"מְחֹלָה","xlit":"mᵉchôlâh","pron":"mek-o-law'","from":"feminine of H4234 (מָחוֹל);","def":"a dance","kjv":"company, dances(-cing).","count":8},"H4247":{"lemma":"מְחִלָּה","xlit":"mᵉchillâh","pron":"mekh-il-law'","from":"from H2490 (חָלַל);","def":"a cavern (as if excavated)","kjv":"cave.","count":1},"H4248":{"lemma":"מַחְלוֹן","xlit":"Machlôwn","pron":"makh-lone'","from":"from H2470 (חָלָה); sick;","def":"Machlon, an Israelite","kjv":"Mahlon.","count":4},"H4249":{"lemma":"מַחְלִי","xlit":"Machlîy","pron":"makh-lee'","from":"from H2470 (חָלָה); sick;","def":"Machli, the name of two Israelites","kjv":"Mahli.","count":12},"H4250":{"lemma":"מַחְלִי","xlit":"Machlîy","pron":"makh-lee'","from":"patronymical from H4249 (מַחְלִי);","def":"a Machlite or (collectively) descendants of Machli","kjv":"Mahlites.","count":2},"H4251":{"lemma":"מַחְלֻי","xlit":"machluy","pron":"makh-loo'-ee","from":"from H2470 (חָלָה);","def":"a disease","kjv":"disease.","count":1},"H4252":{"lemma":"מַחֲלָף","xlit":"machălâph","pron":"makh-al-awf'","from":"from H2498 (חָלַף);","def":"a (sacrificial) knife (as gliding through the flesh)","kjv":"knife.","count":1},"H4253":{"lemma":"מַחְלָפָה","xlit":"machlâphâh","pron":"makh-law-faw'","from":"from H2498 (חָלַף);","def":"a ringlet of hair (as gliding over each other)","kjv":"lock.","count":2},"H4254":{"lemma":"מַחֲלָצָה","xlit":"machălâtsâh","pron":"makh-al-aw-tsaw'","from":"from H2502 (חָלַץ);","def":"a mantle (as easily drawn off)","kjv":"changeable suit of apparel, change of raiment.","count":2},"H4255":{"lemma":"מַחְלְקָה","xlit":"machlᵉqâh","pron":"makh-lek-aw'","from":"(Aramaic) corresponding to H4256 (מַחֲלֹקֶת);","def":"a section (of the Levites)","kjv":"course.","count":1},"H4256":{"lemma":"מַחֲלֹקֶת","xlit":"machălôqeth","pron":"makh-al-o'-keth","from":"from H2505 (חָלַק);","def":"a section (of Levites, people or soldiers)","kjv":"company, course, division, portion. See also H5555 (סֶלַע הַמַּחְלְקוֹת).","count":42},"H4257":{"lemma":"מַחֲלַת","xlit":"machălath","pron":"makh-al-ath'","from":"from H2470 (חָלָה); sickness;","def":"'Machalath', probably the title (initial word) of a popular song","kjv":"Mahalath.","count":2},"H4258":{"lemma":"מַחֲלַת","xlit":"Machălath","pron":"makh-al-ath'","from":"the same as H4257 (מַחֲלַת); sickness;","def":"Machalath, the name of an Ishmaelitess and of an Israelitess","kjv":"Mahalath.","count":2},"H4259":{"lemma":"מְחֹלָתִי","xlit":"Mᵉchôlâthîy","pron":"mekh-o-law-thee'","from":"patrial from H65 (אָבֵל מְחוֹלָה);","def":"a Mecholathite or inhabitant of Abel-Mecholah","kjv":"Mecholathite.","count":2},"H4260":{"lemma":"מַחֲמָאָה","xlit":"machămâʼâh","pron":"makh-am-aw-aw'","from":"a denominative from H2529 (חֶמְאָה);","def":"something buttery (i.e. unctuous and pleasant), as (figuratively) flattery","kjv":"[idiom] than butter.","count":1},"H4261":{"lemma":"מַחְמָד","xlit":"machmâd","pron":"makh-mawd'","from":"from H2530 (חָמַד);","def":"delightful; hence, a delight, i.e. object of affection or desire","kjv":"beloved, desire, goodly, lovely, pleasant (thing).","count":13},"H4262":{"lemma":"מַחְמֻד","xlit":"machmud","pron":"makh-mood'","from":"or מַחְמוּד; from H2530 (חָמַד);","def":"desired; hence, a valuable","kjv":"pleasant thing.","count":1},"H4263":{"lemma":"מַחְמָל","xlit":"machmâl","pron":"makh-mawl'","from":"from H2550 (חָמַל); (by paronomasia with H4261 (מַחְמָד)) delight","def":"properly, sympathy;","kjv":"pitieth.","count":1},"H4264":{"lemma":"מַחֲנֶה","xlit":"machăneh","pron":"makh-an-eh'","from":"from H2583 (חָנָה);","def":"an encampment (of travellers or troops); hence, an army, whether literal (of soldiers) or figurative (of dancers, angels, cattle, locusts, stars; or even the sacred courts)","kjv":"army, band, battle, camp, company, drove, host, tents.","count":215},"H4265":{"lemma":"מַחֲנֵה־דָן","xlit":"Machănêh-Dân","pron":"makh-an-ay'-dawn","from":"from H4264 (מַחֲנֶה) and H1835 (דָּן); camp of Dan;","def":"Machaneh-Dan, a place in Palestine","kjv":"Mahaneh-dan.","count":4},"H4266":{"lemma":"מַחֲנַיִם","xlit":"Machănayim","pron":"makh-an-ah'-yim","from":"dual of H4264 (מַחֲנֶה); double camp;","def":"Machanajim, a place in Palestine","kjv":"Mahanaim.","count":13},"H4267":{"lemma":"מַחֲנַק","xlit":"machănaq","pron":"makh-an-ak'","from":"from H2614 (חָנַק);","def":"choking","kjv":"strangling.","count":1},"H4268":{"lemma":"מַחֲסֶה","xlit":"machăçeh","pron":"makh-as-eh'","from":"or מַחְסֶה; from H2620 (חָסָה);","def":"a shelter (literally or figuratively)","kjv":"hope, (place of) refuge, shelter, trust.","count":20},"H4269":{"lemma":"מַחְסוֹם","xlit":"machçôwm","pron":"makh-sohm'","from":"from H2629 (חָסַם);","def":"a muzzle","kjv":"bridle.","count":1},"H4270":{"lemma":"מַחְסוֹר","xlit":"machçôwr","pron":"makh-sore'","from":"or מַחְסֹר; from H2637 (חָסֵר);","def":"deficiency; hence, impoverishment","kjv":"lack, need, penury, poor, poverty, want.","count":13},"H4271":{"lemma":"מַחְסֵיָה","xlit":"Machçêyâh","pron":"makh-say-yaw'","from":"from H4268 (מַחֲסֶה) and H3050 (יָהּ); refuge of (i.e. in) Jah;","def":"Machsejah, an Israelite","kjv":"Maaseiah.","count":2},"H4272":{"lemma":"מָחַץ","xlit":"mâchats","pron":"maw-khats'","from":"a primitive root;","def":"to dash asunder; by implication, to crush, smash or violently plunge; figuratively, to subdue or destroy","kjv":"dip, pierce (through), smite (through), strike through, wound.","count":14},"H4273":{"lemma":"מַחַץ","xlit":"machats","pron":"makh'-ats","from":"from H4272 (מָחַץ);","def":"a contusion","kjv":"stroke.","count":1},"H4274":{"lemma":"מַחְצֵב","xlit":"machtsêb","pron":"makh-tsabe'","from":"from H2672 (חָצַב);","def":"properly, a hewing; concretely, a quarry","kjv":"hewed(-n).","count":3},"H4275":{"lemma":"מֶחֱצָה","xlit":"mechĕtsâh","pron":"mekh-ets-aw'","from":"from H2673 (חָצָה)lemma חָעָה ayin, corrected to חָצָה;","def":"a halving","kjv":"half.","count":2},"H4276":{"lemma":"מַחֲצִית","xlit":"machătsîyth","pron":"makh-ats-eeth'","from":"from H2673 (חָצָה)lemma חָעָה ayin, corrected to חָצָה;","def":"a halving or the middle","kjv":"half (so much), mid(-day).","count":16},"H4277":{"lemma":"מָחַק","xlit":"mâchaq","pron":"maw-khak'","from":"a primitive root;","def":"to crush","kjv":"smite off.","count":1},"H4278":{"lemma":"מֶחְקָר","xlit":"mechqâr","pron":"mekh-kawr'","from":"from H2713 (חָקַר);","def":"properly, scrutinized, i.e. (by implication) a recess","kjv":"deep place.","count":1},"H4279":{"lemma":"מָחָר","xlit":"mâchâr","pron":"maw-khar'","from":"probably from H309 (אָחַר);","def":"properly, deferred, i.e. the morrow; usually (adverbially) tomorrow; indefinitely, hereafter","kjv":"time to come, tomorrow.","count":52},"H4280":{"lemma":"מַחֲרָאָה","xlit":"machărâʼâh","pron":"makh-ar-aw-aw'","from":"from the same as H2716 (חֶרֶא);","def":"a sink","kjv":"draught house.","count":0},"H4281":{"lemma":"מַחֲרֵשָׁה","xlit":"machărêshâh","pron":"makh-ar-ay-shaw'","from":"from H2790 (חָרַשׁ);","def":"probably a pick-axe","kjv":"mattock.","count":3},"H4282":{"lemma":"מַחֲרֶשֶׁת","xlit":"machăresheth","pron":"makh-ar-eh'-sheth","from":"from H2790 (חָרַשׁ);","def":"probably a hoe","kjv":"share.","count":0},"H4283":{"lemma":"מׇחֳרָת","xlit":"mochŏrâth","pron":"mokh-or-awth'","from":"