'","from":"apparently a denominative from H2916 (טִיט);","def":"a broom (as removing dirt (compare English 'to dust', i.e. remove dust))","kjv":"besom.","count":1},"H4293":{"lemma":"מַטְבֵּחַ","xlit":"maṭbêach","pron":"mat-bay'-akh","from":"from H2873 (טָבַח);","def":"slaughter","kjv":"slaughter.","count":1},"H4294":{"lemma":"מַטֶּה","xlit":"maṭṭeh","pron":"mat-teh'","from":"or (feminine) מַטָּה; from H5186 (נָטָה);","def":"a branch (as extending); figuratively, a tribe; also a rod, whether for chastising (figuratively, correction), ruling (a sceptre), throwing (a lance), or walking (a staff; figuratively, a support of life, e.g. bread)","kjv":"rod, staff, tribe.","count":251},"H4295":{"lemma":"מַטָּה","xlit":"maṭṭâh","pron":"mat'-taw","from":"from H5786 (עָוַר) with directive enclitic appended;","def":"downward, below or beneath; often adverbially with or without prefixes","kjv":"beneath, down(-ward), less, very low, under(-neath).","count":19},"H4296":{"lemma":"מִטָּה","xlit":"miṭṭâh","pron":"mit-taw'","from":"from H5186 (נָטָה);","def":"a bed (as extended) forsleeping or eating; by analogy, a sofa, litter or bier","kjv":"bed(-chamber), bier.","count":29},"H4297":{"lemma":"מֻטֶּה","xlit":"muṭṭeh","pron":"moot-teh'","from":"from H5186 (נָטָה);","def":"a stretching, i.e. distortion (figuratively, iniquity)","kjv":"perverseness.","count":1},"H4298":{"lemma":"מֻטָּה","xlit":"muṭṭâh","pron":"moot-taw'","from":"from H5186 (נָטָה);","def":"expansion","kjv":"stretching out.","count":1},"H4299":{"lemma":"מַטְוֶה","xlit":"maṭveh","pron":"mat-veh'","from":"from H2901 (טָוָה);","def":"something spun","kjv":"spun.","count":1}}